<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Konecta wordmark, converted from konecta.svg for the Android 12+ system
    splash screen.

    Geometry notes, because the splash icon canvas is not a normal drawable:

      * The canvas is 432x432. Only the central 288dp CIRCLE is visible - the
        system masks everything outside it.
      * The wordmark is 178.313 x 29.423 in the source SVG, an aspect ratio of
        about 6:1. Inscribing that in the visible circle with a little margin
        gives a scale of 1.4379, i.e. 256.4 x 42.3 units.
      * The outer group then centres it: x 87.8..344.2, y 194.85..237.15, whose
        midpoint is exactly (216, 216).

    Each inner group reproduces the per-path translate() from the SVG, since
    VectorDrawable has no per-path transform attribute.

    Colour is Konecta blue on the yellow splash background - see
    Theme.Chatcircle.Starting.
-->
